*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
# RUNE panel build artefacts ship with the repo — Lit SPA bundled to a
# single ``panel.html`` plus the HA ``<rune-panel>`` shim at
# ``panel.js``. Both are produced by ``pnpm build`` in
# ``custom_components/rune/frontend/``.
!custom_components/rune/frontend/dist/
!custom_components/rune/frontend/dist/panel.html
!custom_components/rune/frontend/dist/panel.js
*.egg-info/
*.egg
.eggs/
.installed.cfg
*.egg-info
MANIFEST

